  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Missile Fist — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You can launch a barrage of giant fists against your opponents.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you can spend 1 cursed energy as a bonus action to materialize giant fists of cursed energy. Until the end of your turn, you can replace any of your attacks with a <em>Missile Fist</em>, making a ranged Cursed Energy attack against a creature within 20 ft. A <em>Missile Fist</em> does 1d8 + your CE modifier necrotic damage on a hit. As part of the bonus action you use to activate this technique, you can make one additional <em>Missile Fist</em> attack. If you use <em>Missile Fist</em> against a creature within 5 ft, you can instead make a melee Cursed Energy attack that can use your Strength or Dexterity modifier for the attack and damage rolls.</p>\n<p>The damage of your <em>Missile Fist</em> increases to 2d8 at 6th level, 3d8 at 11th level, and 4d8 at 18th level.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
